{
    "title": "ASMR Rainbow Jelly",
    "description": "Jam-packed with Jellies! Get it? ASMR Rainbow Food is filled with colorful swets!\r\nThe best-ever mukbang game is here! In ASMR Rainbow Food, you can eat all the delicious rainbow colored food from gummies to candies! Turn on the sound to enjoy the oddly satisfying ASMR chewing sounds.\r\nHave you ever dreamed of becoming a mukbang Youtuber? Your wish has been granted. Chew, munch, chomp and devour through endless desserts for free!\r\nASMR Rainbow Jelly will take your mukbang skills to the next level and give you the satisfaction that you have ever wanted.\r\nChew your way through to unlock more rainbow desserts!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Jam-packed with Jellies! Get it? ASMR Rainbow Food is filled with colorful swets!<br>The best-ever mukbang game is here! In ASMR Rainbow Food, you can eat all the delicious rainbow colored food from gummies to candies! Turn on the sound to enjoy the oddly satisfying ASMR chewing sounds.<br>Have you ever dreamed of becoming a mukbang Youtuber? Your wish has been granted. Chew, munch, chomp and devour through endless desserts for free!<br>ASMR Rainbow Jelly will take your mukbang skills to the next level and give you the satisfaction that you have ever wanted.<br>Chew your way through to unlock more rainbow desserts!",
